{
    "interface_version": 2,
    "name": "MaaNOP",
    "label": "MaaNOP",
    "version": "v2.3.0",
    "github": "https://github.com/ArcherSore/MaaNOP",
    "controller": [
        {
            "name": "Win32Desktop",
            "label": "桌面端",
            "type": "Win32",
            "win32": {
                "class_regex": ".*",
                "window_regex": "火影忍者Online",
                "screencap": "PrintWindow",
                "mouse": "Seize",
                "keyboard": "Seize"
            }
        }
    ],
    "resource": [
        {
            "name": "NarutoMiniClient",
            "label": "火影微端",
            "path": [ "./resource/" ]
        }
    ],
    "agent": {
        "child_exec": "./python/python.exe",
        "child_args": [
            "./agent/main.py"
        ]
    },
    "group": [
        {
            "name": "AltAccount",
            "label": "练小号"
        },
        {
            "name": "LimitedEvent",
            "label": "限时活动"
        },
        {
            "name": "Routine",
            "label": "日常任务"
        }
    ],
    "task": [
        {
            "name": "AccountLeveling",
            "label": "注册并练级",
            "group": [ "AltAccount" ],
            "entry": "AccountLeveling",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**选服务器界面**，并设置好服务器范围和账号名前缀。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n按设置的服务器范围，依次注册新账号并练到 **16 级**。\n\n账号名采用「前缀 + 服务器编号」的格式。例如，前缀为 `X`、服务器为 `1006`，则账号名为 `X1006`。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n服务器范围支持连续区间和多个区间，例如：`10-16,18-20`，表示选择 10～16 服和 18～20 服。\n\n多个区间之间请使用**英文逗号 `,`** 分隔。",
            "option": [ "ServerRegionType", "ServerRange", "AccountNamePrefix" ]
        },
        {
            "name": "AccountClaims",
            "label": "批量领取",
            "group": [ "AltAccount" ],
            "entry": "AccountClaims",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**选服务器界面**，并确认目标服务器的账号已完成**注册和练级**。\n\n设置好服务器范围，并勾选需要领取的奖励。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n按设置的服务器范围，依次登录并执行已勾选的任务。\n\n#### 领取等级经验\n\n- **任务内容**：使用铜币找回 50% 经验，获得 **300,000 经验**。\n- **使用目的**：帮助小号升到 **30 级**，为后续领取回归奖励做准备。\n- **推荐阶段**：小号 **16～30 级**期间。\n- **注意事项**：请确保账号有足够的铜币。\n\n#### 领取回归奖励\n\n- **任务内容**：领取连续 **7 天未登录**后可获得的回归点券奖励。\n- **使用目的**：酷酷攒点券。\n- **推荐阶段**：**30级**以后使用，一路攒到游戏倒闭。\n\n#### 领取邮件附件\n\n- **任务内容**：领取邮件附件，包括每周更新补偿、幻象奖励等邮件中的点券。\n- **使用目的**：点券不漏领，继续酷酷攒。\n- **推荐阶段**：长期使用，推荐每7天领一次即可。\n\n#### 领取幻象奖励\n\n- **任务内容**：执行幻象扫荡，用于完成每周一次的扫荡。\n- **使用目的**：获取幻象奖励，继续酷酷攒点券。\n- **推荐阶段**：小号达到 **52 级**后。\n- **注意事项**：\n  - 每周执行一次即可，重复运行仍会再次扫荡。\n  - 暂不支持自动完成首次伤害，请先手动完成。",
            "option": [ "ServerRegionType", "ServerRange", "ClaimLevelExp", "ClaimMail", "ClaimInfiniteIllusion", "ClaimReturnGift" ]
        },
        {
            "name": "ArenaRankGrind",
            "label": "竞技场一键六道",
            "entry": "ArenaRankGrind",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**竞技场主界面**，或能够看到**竞技场入口**的界面。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n自动进入竞技场并连续挑战，达到**六道段位**后停止。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 不会自动领取**月印奖励**，请手动领取。\n- 已达到**六道段位**时，不会继续挑战。"
        },
        {
            "name": "ThemeArena",
            "label": "主题竞技场",
            "group": [ "LimitedEvent" ],
            "entry": "ThemeArena",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**主题竞技场主界面**，并选择停止条件。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n自动点击**战斗**并托管，反复挑战直到达成目标。\n\n### 目标\n\n- **六道**：达到**六道段位**后停止。\n- **九胜**：**胜利 9 场**的**领取**按钮亮起后停止。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n不会自动领取奖励，请手动领取。",
            "option": [ "ThemeArenaEndCondition" ],
            "pipeline_override": {
                "WaitBattleEnd": {
                    "next": [ "[JumpBack]ThemeBattleResultPopup", "WaitThemeMain" ]
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "ShoppingFestivalTask",
            "label": "购物节送字",
            "group": [ "AltAccount" ],
            "entry": "ShoppingFestivalTask",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**选服务器界面**，并设置好服务器范围和赠送对象名称。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n每次购买 **3 个字**，并自动赠送给指定的大号。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n开始前，请确认以下条件均已满足：\n\n- **大号保持在线**。\n- **已手动添加好友**：送字的小号已将大号加为好友。\n- **当天首页有符合价格条件的商品**：首页四个商品中，**至少有一个的价格能整除 1500**（即 1500 ÷ 商品价格为整数）。任务**不会向下滚动查找商品**。\n- **当天未送过字**：请勿重复处理同一个小号。",
            "option": [ "ServerRegionType", "ServerRange", "ShoppingFriendName" ]
        },
        {
            "name": "SurvivalDrill",
            "label": "生存演习",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "SurvivalDrill",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**，或已在**生存演习界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n打完当前难度的上一轮并领奖；有重置次数时重置，切到设置的难度，挑战至**积分满分**并领奖，最后关闭界面。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 没有重置次数时，只打完上一轮并领奖。\n- **极限**未解锁时自动使用**极限之卷**；卷不足则改打**精英**。",
            "option": [ "SurvivalLevel" ]
        },
        {
            "name": "AbundanceRoom",
            "label": "丰饶之间",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "AbundanceRoom",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n切换到设置的队伍，进入**丰饶之间**，以**简单**难度反复挑战**赏金试炼**（自动托管、加速、领收益），直到本日次数用完。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 只打赏金试炼，不打经验试炼。\n- 队伍需已解锁，否则任务会停在选队伍。\n- 每场消耗 **10 点体力**。",
            "option": [ "AbundanceTeam" ]
        },
        {
            "name": "PowerfulBoss",
            "label": "强者降临",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "PowerfulBoss",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**，并在游戏里选好自己打得过的难度。任务**不会选难度**，沿用上次的选择。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n切换到设置的队伍，用当前难度**单人**反复挑战（自动托管、加速、领奖），直到**本周可用普通奖励次数**为 **0**。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 队伍需已解锁，否则任务会停在选队伍。\n- 战斗**失败**时任务显示**失败**（不扣次数），请换低一点的难度。\n- 连续打满 **12 场**次数仍未用完（读数异常）时，任务显示**失败**。\n- 每场消耗 1 次，每周共 6 次。",
            "option": [ "BossTeam" ],
            "pipeline_override": {
                "AbundanceTeamClose": {
                    "next": [ "BossGotoWindow", "AbundanceTeamClose" ]
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "OnlineReward",
            "label": "在线领奖",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "OnlineReward",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n领取**福利大厅**里**现在可领**的在线礼包。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 不等待倒计时，未到时间的礼包会跳过。\n- 礼包按在线时长解锁，要领完当天全部，需在不同时间多次运行。"
        },
        {
            "name": "TrainingJournal",
            "label": "修行录领取",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "TrainingJournal",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n领取**忍者修行录**「任务」页签里所有可领取的奖励（含领完后换上的下一档）。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n不领取「奖励」页签。"
        },
        {
            "name": "NinjaQuiz",
            "label": "忍者测验",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "NinjaQuiz",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n通过**日常锻炼**参与**忍者测验**，10 道题**都选第一个选项**，答完领奖。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 不判断对错，通常只能答对两三题，奖励较少。\n- 今天已完成时直接结束。\n- 角色走向考官途中请勿操作，否则任务会失败。"
        },
        {
            "name": "WantedTask",
            "label": "通缉任务",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "WantedTask",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n切换到设置的队伍，通过**日常锻炼**参与**通缉任务**，点**自动完成**（单人），由游戏跑完今天剩下的所有轮次，最后核对**参与**已变灰。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 只做**单人**，拿不到组队双倍经验。\n- 全部做完约十分钟，期间请**勿操作角色**，否则会中断。\n- 今天已完成时直接结束。\n- 核对时仍有剩余次数会再参与一次；连续 **3 次**没做完，任务显示**失败**。\n- 队伍需已解锁，否则任务会停在选队伍。",
            "option": [ "WantedTeam" ],
            "pipeline_override": {
                "AbundanceTeamClose": {
                    "next": [ "WantedOpenDaily", "AbundanceTeamClose" ]
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "TeamDungeon",
            "label": "组队副本",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "TeamDungeon",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n切换到设置的队伍，通过**日常锻炼**的**限时活动**参与**组队副本**，在**全部副本**里选好副本和难度，**单人**进入并托管、加速；打赢后返回游戏继续，直到**本日奖励次数**（或本周奖励次数）为 **0**。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 只打**单人**，不匹配队友。\n- 战斗**失败**（不扣次数）、副本未解锁或调不到所选难度时，任务显示**失败**。\n- 偶尔出现**精英忍者**：结算后又进入战斗会照常打完；出现其他带「精英」字样的界面会**停下**，请手动处理（尚未实测）。\n- 队伍需已解锁，否则任务会停在选队伍。",
            "option": [ "TeamDungeonTeam", "TeamDungeonName", "TeamDungeonDifficulty" ],
            "pipeline_override": {
                "AbundanceTeamClose": {
                    "next": [ "TeamDungeonOpenDaily", "AbundanceTeamClose" ]
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "AutoManagement",
            "label": "游戏托管",
            "group": [ "Routine" ],
            "entry": "AutoManagement",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n停留在**主界面**，并在游戏的**托管设置**里勾选好要做的项目。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n开始托管，第一轮做完（含忍者考试扫荡、家园浇水）后自动退出。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n- 每天第一次托管消耗 **1 张托管卡**。\n- 请勿勾选「空闲时自动停靠在温泉」。\n- 设置了二级密码时，请勿勾选「兑换商人」。"
        },
        {
            "name": "NinjutsuTraining",
            "label": "忍术特训",
            "group": [ "LimitedEvent" ],
            "entry": "NinjutsuTrainingEntry",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**忍术特训界面**，确保能看到**「开启特训」按钮**。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n自动完成忍术特训并领取奖励。\n\n### 注意事项\n\n其他活动中的忍术特训也可能适用，可以尝试使用。"
        },
        {
            "name": "MidAutumnLantern",
            "label": "中秋盛典",
            "group": [ "LimitedEvent" ],
            "entry": "MidAutumnLanternEntry",
            "description": "### 开始前\n\n请停留在**中秋盛典点灯笼界面**，确保能看到**「开始」按钮**，并且还有剩余参与券。\n\n### 会做什么\n\n识别初始的两盏灯笼，自动点亮其余 **14 盏**，使五种灯笼各至少 3 盏，然后领取奖励。"
        }
    ],
    "option": {
        "ServerRegionType": {
            "type": "select",
            "label": "大区类型",
            "description": "选择服务器大区类型（公测 / 不删档 / 联盟）",
            "default_case": "Public",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Public",
                    "label": "公测",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "SetServerRegion": {
                            "recognition": {
                                "type": "Custom",
                                "param": {
                                    "custom_recognition": "SetServerRegion",
                                    "custom_recognition_param": "public"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "NonWipe",
                    "label": "不删档",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "SetServerRegion": {
                            "recognition": {
                                "type": "Custom",
                                "param": {
                                    "custom_recognition": "SetServerRegion",
                                    "custom_recognition_param": "non_wipe"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Alliance",
                    "label": "联盟",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "SetServerRegion": {
                            "recognition": {
                                "type": "Custom",
                                "param": {
                                    "custom_recognition": "SetServerRegion",
                                    "custom_recognition_param": "alliance"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "ServerRange": {
            "type": "input",
            "label": "服务器选择",
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "server_range",
                    "label": "服务器范围",
                    "description": "输入服务器范围, 格式如: 10-16,18-20",
                    "default": "978-1012",
                    "pipeline_type": "string",
                    "verify": "^(?:\\d+(?:-\\d+)?)(?:,\\d+(?:-\\d+)?)*$",
                    "pattern_msg": "请输入正确格式, 如: 10-16,18-20"
                }
            ],
            "pipeline_override": {
                "ParseServer": {
                    "recognition": {
                        "type": "Custom",
                        "param": {
                            "custom_recognition": "ParseServerRange",
                            "custom_recognition_param": "{server_range}"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "AccountNamePrefix": {
            "type": "input",
            "label": "",
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "name_prefix",
                    "label": "账号前缀",
                    "description": "账号名 = 前缀 + 服务器编号，如 X → X1006",
                    "default": "X",
                    "pipeline_type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "pipeline_override": {
                "GetAccountPrefix": {
                    "recognition": {
                        "type": "Custom",
                        "param": {
                            "custom_recognition": "GenerateAccountName",
                            "custom_recognition_param": "{name_prefix}"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "ClaimLevelExp": {
            "type": "switch",
            "label": "等级经验",
            "default_case": "Yes",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Yes",
                    "label": "领取"
                },
                {
                    "name": "No",
                    "label": "不领取",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "ClaimLevelEntry": {
                            "enabled": false
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "ClaimReturnGift": {
            "type": "switch",
            "label": "回归奖励",
            "default_case": "Yes",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Yes",
                    "label": "领取"
                },
                {
                    "name": "No",
                    "label": "不领取",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "ClaimReturnGiftEntry": {
                            "enabled": false
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "ClaimMail": {
            "type": "switch",
            "label": "邮件附件",
            "default_case": "Yes",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Yes",
                    "label": "领取"
                },
                {
                    "name": "No",
                    "label": "不领取",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "ClaimMailEntry": {
                            "enabled": false
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "ClaimInfiniteIllusion": {
            "type": "switch",
            "label": "幻象奖励",
            "default_case": "Yes",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Yes",
                    "label": "领取"
                },
                {
                    "name": "No",
                    "label": "不领取",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "ClaimInfiniteIllusionEntry": {
                            "enabled": false
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "ThemeArenaEndCondition": {
            "type": "select",
            "label": "目标",
            "default_case": "Rikudou",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Rikudou",
                    "label": "六道",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "ThemeNineWinsReached": {
                            "enabled": false
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "NineWins",
                    "label": "九胜",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "ThemeRikudouReached": {
                            "enabled": false
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "SurvivalLevel": {
            "type": "select",
            "label": "演习难度",
            "default_case": "Elite",
            "cases": [
                {
                    "name": "Normal",
                    "label": "普通",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "SurvivalTabSelected": {
                            "recognition": {
                                "param": {
                                    "template": "survival/TabNormalSelected.png"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "SurvivalClickTab": {
                            "action": {
                                "param": {
                                    "target": [ 355, 150, 35, 50 ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Elite",
                    "label": "精英"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Extreme",
                    "label": "极限",
                    "pipeline_override": {
                        "SurvivalTabSelected": {
                            "recognition": {
                                "param": {
                                    "template": "survival/TabExtremeSelected.png"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "SurvivalClickTab": {
                            "action": {
                                "param": {
                                    "target": [ 470, 145, 35, 50 ]
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        "AbundanceTeam": {
            "type": "input",
            "label": "",
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "abundance_team",
                    "label": "出战队伍",
                    "description": "从上到下编号（1～8）",
                    "default": "1",
                    "pipeline_type": "int",
                    "verify": "^[1-8]$",
                    "pattern_msg": "请输入 1～8 的数字"
                }
            ],
            "pipeline_override": {
